DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       These  functions calculate the complex arc hyperbolic tangent of _z.  If
       _y _= _c_a_t_a_n_h_(_z_), then _z _= _c_t_a_n_h_(_y_).  The imaginary part of _y is chosen in
       the interval [-pi/2,pi/2].

       One has:

           catanh(z) = 0.5 * (clog(1 + z) - clog(1 - z))

